    "description": "Stripe-powered subscription billing with plans, feature quotas, usage tracking, customer portal, and webhook sync. Implements StandardContracts::BILLING and emits eight outbound workflow triggers (subscription_created, subscription_cancelled, subscription_renewed, payment_failed, payment_succeeded, plan_changed, trial_started, trial_ended). Provides workflow actions for sending payment links, cancelling subscriptions, checking subscription status, assigning plans, and recording usage. Exposes connector query surfaces for subscriptions, invoices, and feature usage.",
